      "title": "More than a dozen arrested in connection with 2021 assassination of Haitian president",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/more-than-a-dozen-arrested-in-connection-with-assassination-of-haitian-president",
      "description": "<p>Jovenel Moïse, 53, was shot dead in July 2021 in a killing which sparked chaos in Haiti</p><p>Eighteen people have been arrested in association with the 2021 assassination of the Haitian president Jovenel Moïse, according to US officials.</p><p>Moïse, 53, was shot dead on 7 July 2021 at his private residence by a hired group of about 20 military-trained Colombian mercenaries. His security detail did not intervene to protect him.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/more-than-a-dozen-arrested-in-connection-with-assassination-of-haitian-president\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-20T20:17:44"
    },
    {
      "title": "Thirty More Arrested in Jovenel Moïse Assassination",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/20/world/americas/haiti-assassination-trial-moise.html",
      "description": "The suspects in the 2021 assassination of President Jovenel Moïse include 18 men who were extradited from Haiti to Miami, officials said.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-09-20T22:20:25"
